<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Lab2Web - Biodata Mahasiswa</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            background-color: #f4f6f8;
            color: #222;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b 0%, #f97316 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 30px 20px;
        }

        .header-brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .header-logo {
            width: 140px;
            height: auto;
            display: block;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 3px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2));
        }

        .header-text {
            text-align: left;
        }

        header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 32px;
        }

        header p {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        nav {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b 0%, #f97316 100%);
            padding: 15px;
            text-align: center;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #fff7ed;
        }

        main {
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 30px auto;
        }

        section,
        article,
        aside {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        }

        h2 {
            color: #f97316;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #f97316;
            padding-bottom: 8px;
        }

        h3 {
            color: #c2410c;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        table,
        th,
        td {
            border: 1px solid #555;
        }

        th {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b 0%, #f97316 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 12px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        td {
            padding: 10px;
        }

        tbody tr:nth-child(even) {
            background-color: #f1f5f9;
        }

        tfoot {
            font-weight: bold;
            background-color: #ffedd5;
        }

        form {
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        input[type="text"],
        input[type="email"],
        input[type="password"],
        input[type="date"],
        input[type="number"],
        select,
        textarea {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 10px;
            border: 1px solid #aaa;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        input[type="radio"],
        input[type="checkbox"] {
            margin-right: 7px;
        }

        .radio-group label,
        .checkbox-group label {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-right: 20px;
            font-weight: normal;
        }

        textarea {
            resize: vertical;
        }

        button {
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-right: 8px;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        button[type="submit"] {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b 0%, #f97316 100%);
            color: white;
        }

        button[type="reset"] {
            background-color: #f59e0b;
            color: white;
        }

        button:hover {
            opacity: 0.85;
        }

        .media-box {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        audio,
        video {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .info-box {
            background-color: #fff7ed;
            border-left: 5px solid #f97316;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }

        footer {
            background-color: #1e293b;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .data-diri {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 150px 1fr;
            gap: 8px;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        .data-diri strong {
            color: #c2410c;
        }

        @media (max-width: 700px) {
            .header-brand {
                flex-direction: column;
                text-align: center;
            }

            .header-text {
                text-align: center;
            }

            nav a {
                display: block;
                margin: 8px;
            }

            main {
                width: 95%;
            }

            .data-diri {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            table {
                font-size: 13px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header id="beranda">
        <div class="header-brand">
            <img src="logo-upb.svg" alt="Logo Universitas Pelita Bangsa" class="header-logo">
            <div class="header-text">
                <h1>Portal Mahasiswa</h1>
                <p>Praktikum Pemrograman Web - HTML Lanjutan</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <a href="#beranda">Beranda</a>
        <a href="#mahasiswa">Data Mahasiswa</a>
        <a href="#form">Form Registrasi</a>
        <a href="#multimedia">Multimedia</a>
        <a href="#biodata">Biodata</a>
    </nav>

    <main>

        <section id="mahasiswa">
            <h2>1. Data Mahasiswa</h2>
            <p>
                Berikut adalah contoh tabel data mahasiswa.
                Tabel menggunakan elemen <b>table</b>, <b>thead</b>,
                <b>tbody</b>, dan <b>tfoot</b>.
            </p>

            <table>
                <caption><strong>Data Mahasiswa Teknik Informatika</strong></caption>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>NIM</th>
                        <th>Nama</th>
                        <th>Program Studi</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr><td>312510339</td><td>Rahsya Alfrendika</td><td>Teknik Informatika</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>312510389</td><td>Pahmi Dwika Fahlevi</td><td>Teknik Informatika</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>312510303</td><td>fikry</td><td>Sistem Informasi</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>312510304</td><td>febryan</td><td>Teknik Informatika</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>312510339</td><td>Andika</td><td>Teknik Informatika</td></tr>
                </tbody>
                <tfoot>
                    <tr>
                        <td colspan="2">Jumlah Mahasiswa</td>
                        <td>5 Orang</td>
                    </tr>
                </tfoot>
            </table>
        </section>

        <section id="nilai">
            <h2>2. Nilai Praktikum</h2>
            <table border="1">
                <caption><strong>Nilai Praktikum Mahasiswa</strong></caption>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>No</th>
                        <th>Nama</th>
                        <th>Nilai</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr><td>1</td><td>Rahsya Alfrendika</td><td>85</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>2</td><td>Pahmi Dwika Fahlevi</td><td>90</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>3</td><td>fikry</td><td>88</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>4</td><td>febryan</td><td>92</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>5</td><td>Andika</td><td>86</td></tr>
                </tbody>
                <tfoot>
                    <tr>
                        <td colspan="2">Rata-rata</td>
                        <td>88.6</td>
                    </tr>
                </tfoot>
            </table>

            <div class="info-box">
                <strong>Eksperimen:</strong>
                Perhatikan penggunaan <code>colspan="2"</code>
                pada bagian footer tabel untuk menggabungkan dua kolom.
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="form">
            <h2>3. Form Registrasi Mahasiswa</h2>
            <form action="#" method="post">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="nama">Nama Lengkap</label>
                    <input type="text" id="nama" name="nama" placeholder="Masukkan nama lengkap" required minlength="3">
                </div>

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="email">Email</label>
                    <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="contoh@email.com" required>
                </div>

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="password">Password</label>
                    <input type="password" id="password" name="password" placeholder="Masukkan password" minlength="6" required>
                </div>

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="tanggal">Tanggal Lahir</label>
                    <input type="date" id="tanggal" name="tanggal" required>
                </div>

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>Jenis Kelamin</label>
                    <div class="radio-group">
                        <label><input type="radio" id="laki" name="jk" value="L" required> Laki-laki</label>
                        <label><input type="radio" id="perempuan" name="jk" value="P"> Perempuan</label>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>Keahlian</label>
                    <div class="checkbox-group">
                        <label><input type="checkbox" id="html" name="skill" value="HTML"> HTML</label>
                        <label><input type="checkbox" id="css" name="skill" value="CSS"> CSS</label>
                        <label><input type="checkbox" id="javascript" name="skill" value="JavaScript"> JavaScript</label>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="prodi">Program Studi</label>
                    <select id="prodi" name="prodi" required>
                        <option value="">-- Pilih Prodi --</option>
                        <option value="ti">Teknik Informatika</option>
                        <option value="si">Sistem Informasi</option>
                        <option value="mi">Manajemen Informatika</option>
                    </select>
                </div>

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="alamat">Alamat</label>
                    <textarea id="alamat" name="alamat" rows="5" placeholder="Masukkan alamat lengkap" required></textarea>
                </div>

                <button type="submit">Daftar</button>
                <button type="reset">Reset</button>
            </form>
        </section>

        <section id="validasi">
            <h2>4. Validasi Form Dasar</h2>
            <p>
                Form berikut digunakan untuk menguji validasi HTML.
                Silakan klik tombol <b>Kirim</b> tanpa mengisi data.
            </p>

            <form action="#" method="post">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="nama-validasi">Nama</label>
                    <input type="text" id="nama-validasi" name="nama" required minlength="3" placeholder="Minimal 3 karakter">
                </div>

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="email-validasi">Email</label>
                    <input type="email" id="email-validasi" name="email" required placeholder="Masukkan email">
                </div>

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="umur">Umur</label>
                    <input type="number" id="umur" name="umur" min="17" max="60" required placeholder="17 - 60">
                </div>

                <button type="submit">Kirim</button>
            </form>

            <div class="info-box">
                <strong>Uji validasi:</strong>
                Coba klik tombol Kirim tanpa mengisi data.
                Browser akan menampilkan pesan bahwa data wajib diisi.
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="semantic">
            <h2>5. Struktur Semantic HTML</h2>
            <article>
                <h3>Praktikum HTML Lanjutan</h3>
                <p>
                    Mahasiswa mempelajari tabel, form,
                    semantic HTML, multimedia, dan validasi.
                </p>
            </article>

            <aside>
                <h3>Informasi Tambahan</h3>
                <p>
                    Semantic HTML membuat struktur halaman
                    lebih mudah dipahami oleh browser,
                    mesin pencari, dan developer.
                </p>
            </aside>
        </section>

        <section id="multimedia">
            <h2>6. Multimedia</h2>

            <div class="media-box">
                <h3>Audio</h3>
                <p>Contoh elemen audio HTML5:</p>
                <audio controls preload="none">
                    <source src="https://www.soundhelix.com/examples/mp3/SoundHelix-Song-1.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
                    Browser Anda tidak mendukung elemen audio.
                </audio>
            </div>

            <div class="media-box">
                <h3>Video</h3>
                <p>Contoh elemen video HTML5:</p>
                <video controls width="480" preload="metadata">
                    <source src="https://interactive-examples.mdn.mozilla.net/media/cc0-videos/flower.mp4" type="video/mp4">
                    Browser Anda tidak mendukung elemen video.
                </video>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="biodata">
            <h2>7. Proyek Mini - Biodata Mahasiswa</h2>
            <article>
                <h3>Data Mahasiswa</h3>
                <table>
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th>Data</th>
                            <th>Keterangan</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr><td>NIM</td><td>312510389</tr>
                        <tr><td>Nama</td><td>Pahmi Dwika Fahlevi</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>Program Studi</td><td>Teknik Informatika</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>Jenis Kelamin</td><td>Laki-Laki</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>Email</td><td>pahmidwikafahlevi@email.com</td></tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </article>

            <article>
                <h3>Form Biodata</h3>
                <form action="#" method="post">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="bio-nama">Nama</label>
                        <input type="text" id="bio-nama" name="nama" required minlength="3" placeholder="Masukkan nama">
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="bio-email">Email</label>
                        <input type="email" id="bio-email" name="email" required placeholder="Masukkan email">
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="bio-prodi">Program Studi</label>
                        <select id="bio-prodi" name="prodi" required>
                            <option value="">-- Pilih Prodi --</option>
                            <option value="ti">Teknik Informatika</option>
                            <option value="si">Sistem Informasi</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="bio-alamat">Alamat</label>
                        <textarea id="bio-alamat" name="alamat" rows="5" required placeholder="Masukkan alamat"></textarea>
                    </div>

                    <button type="submit">Simpan</button>
                    <button type="reset">Reset</button>
                </form>
            </article>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Kesimpulan Praktikum</h2>
            <p>
                Pada praktikum ini telah dibuat halaman web menggunakan
                HTML lanjutan yang terdiri dari tabel data mahasiswa,
                form registrasi, radio button, checkbox, select,
                textarea, validasi form, semantic HTML, multimedia,
                serta proyek mini biodata mahasiswa.
            </p>

            <p>
                Halaman ini juga menggunakan atribut HTML seperti
                <b>required</b>, <b>minlength</b>, <b>min</b>,
                <b>max</b>, <b>type</b>, <b>id</b>, <b>name</b>,
                <b>value</b>, dan <b>colspan</b>.
            </p>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Teknik Informatika</p>
        <p>Praktikum Pemrograman Web - Lab2Web</p>
    </footer>
</body>

</html>
